        // ------------------------------------------------------------------
        // Wingman flights — 34 flights of four (136 planes), 400 m apart in Z, in
        // two lanes: z -8400..-3600 and z 6000..14000 (the gap keeps clear of the
        // patrol plan's box around the origin). This is the group that hammers
        // ControllerContext: each wingman does a linear peer scan every tick, and at
        // 500 planes that scan is 5× longer than in stress_100.
        //   generic ×10, business ×6, electric ×6 — same-type flights, tight slots
        //   tanker ×4, cargo ×4 — same-type heavy flights, wide slots
        //   tanker-led generic ×2, cargo-led business ×2 — mixed flights at 130 m/s
        // Heavy and mixed flights use ~70 m lateral slots so the spans clear.
        // Wingmen fly at their leader's speed and fuel load.
